OL,4,G0100FThe Gruff Rhys Playlist
OL,5,     GGruff Rhys of Super Furry Animals
OL,6,     Gpulls together a playlist of his
OL,7,     Gfavourite tracks ahead of the
OL,8,     G6Music Festival, with some
OL,9,     GJapanese prog, Turkish pop and
OL,10,     Gthe odd birdcall.
OL,11,G0200F6 Music Festival Highlights
OL,12,     GGruff Rhys, who performed at the
OL,13,     G6 Music Festival in Cardiff,
OL,14,     Gselects highlights from previous
OL,15,     Gfestivals, including Gwenno in
OL,16,     GBristol in 2016 and the Fall in
OL,17,     GTyneside in 2015.
